{"id":"b769360437f9e54a","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-successor-function.md","title":"Successor Function","display":"df-successor-function — Successor Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-successor-function","aliases":["90-df-successor-function"],"display":"df-successor-function — Successor Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-successor-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-successor-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-successor-function — Successor Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (自然数集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(S : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (后继函数, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\nS:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;S(x)=x+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\nS:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;S(x)=x+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>: 后继函数，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+1\">\\(x+1\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是原始递归函数族的基础函数之一</li>\n<li>对应语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 的后继符号</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a> — 零函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a> — 投影函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb{N}$ (自然数集, see [[90-df-omega]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"9f760cc852de5c08","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-zero-function]] — 零函数","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"4d499aedd34b7bfd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-projection-function]] — 投影函数","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"S : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\nS:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;S(x)=x+1.","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x+1","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"L_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false}],"bytes":848,"backlinks":[{"id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z,S,\\pi_i^n$ 见 [[90-df-zero-function]]、[[90-df-successor-function]]、[[90-df-projection-function]]；$Z$ 仍为一元零函数。$\\mathrm{Closure}$ 见 [[90-df-closure-operator]]。复合与原始递归见 [[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]；$\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}$ 是 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]] 已定义的、在类型不相容输入上返回 $Z$ 的全算子族。$f$ 为候选有限元数值全函数。此处保留本册的 $\\mathrm{Base},\\mathrm{PR}$ 名称和同一正元基底。"},{"id":"220648f3ca864e2c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$S : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}$ (后继函数, see [[90-df-successor-function]])"},{"id":"26d87d9e35a83cd9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-successor-function]] — 后继函数"},{"id":"46caa19bb1e0ac82","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$S : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}$ (后继函数, see [[90-df-successor-function]])"},{"id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F$、$\\operatorname{Closure}$ 取 [[90-df-closure-operator]]；$Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-zero-function]]、[[90-df-successor-function]]、[[90-df-projection-function]]，其中 $Z$ 保持一元。"},{"id":"4d499aedd34b7bfd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-successor-function]] — 后继函数"},{"id":"9f760cc852de5c08","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-successor-function]] — 后继函数"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"coun